# Shared by every image built from this repository — the CLI image at the root
# and the two in packages/server — so keep the exclusions to things no build
# needs. Each Dockerfile then COPYs only the workspace members it wants.

# Installed and built inside the image. Copying the host's copies in would risk
# shipping a stale dist, and node_modules built for the host's platform.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Never belongs in a build context, secrets least of all.
.env
.env.*
.dev.vars
**/.wrangler

.git
.gitignore
.github

# Neither the CLI nor the server loads any of this at runtime.
website
Formula
BRAND.md

# Local scratch.
**/coverage
**/.DS_Store
